### Steps to reproduce

1. Ensure System NavigationBar is large enough for better observation
2. Run the code sample
3. Tap showBottomSheet button
4. Observe bottom sheet opening animations and `ViewInsets` updating deltas

### Initial Investigation:
In 3.41,  `ViewInsets`'s updating deltas decrease to near zero.
In 3.44,  `ViewInsets`'s last updating delta is way largger. 

If setting
```java
activity.getWindow().getDecorView().setSystemUiVisibility(View.SYSTEM_UI_FLAG_LAYOUT_STABLE
              | View.SYSTEM_UI_FLAG_LAYOUT_HIDE_NAVIGATION
              | View.SYSTEM_UI_FLAG_LAYOUT_FULLSCREEN);
```
 to enable `edgeToEdge` mode, which is the implementation in Flutter 3.41. It work as expected.

### Futher Investigation:
If modified the System NavigationBar height via `xposed`.
`ViewInsets`'s last updating delta roughly equals to the modified NavigationBar height. 
So the last updating delta is very likely the NavigationBar height, which makes the bottom sheet animation jump at the end.

Reproduced on Android 11, 13, 14.


### Expected results

In 3.41,  Bottom sheet opening animations looks smooth, `ViewInsets`'s updating deltas decrease to near zero.

### Actual results

In 3.44, Bottom sheet opening animations is jumping at the end, `ViewInsets`'s last updating delta is way largger. 


### Code sample

<details open><summary>Code sample</summary>

```dart
import 'package:flutter/material.dart';
import 'package:flutter/services.dart';

void main() {
  WidgetsFlutterBinding.ensureInitialized();
  SystemChrome.setEnabledSystemUIMode(.edgeToEdge);
  runApp(const MaterialApp(home: MyHomePage()));
}

class MyHomePage extends StatelessWidget {
  const MyHomePage({super.key});

  @override
  Widget build(BuildContext context) {
    final padding = MediaQuery.paddingOf(context);
    return Material(
      child: Center(
        child: Column(
          mainAxisAlignment: .center,
          children: [
            Text(
              'EdgeInsets(${padding.left.toStringAsFixed(2)}, ${padding.top.toStringAsFixed(2)}, ${padding.right.toStringAsFixed(2)}, ${padding.bottom.toStringAsFixed(2)})',
              style: const TextStyle(fontSize: 18),
            ),
            TextButton(
              onPressed: () {
                double lastViewInsets = 0;
                String delta = 'ViewInsets updating delta: \n';

                showModalBottomSheet(
                  context: context,
                  enableDrag: false,
                  useSafeArea: true,
                  isScrollControlled: true,
                  builder: (context) {
                    final viewInsets = MediaQuery.viewInsetsOf(context).bottom;
                    delta +=
                        '${(viewInsets - lastViewInsets).toStringAsFixed(2)}, ';
                    lastViewInsets = viewInsets;
                    return Padding(
                      padding: .fromLTRB(14, 14, 14, 14 + viewInsets),
                      child: Column(
                        spacing: 12,
                        mainAxisSize: .min,
                        crossAxisAlignment: .start,
                        children: [
                          SizedBox(
                            height: 100,
                            child: Text(
                              delta,
                              style: const TextStyle(fontSize: 16),
                            ),
                          ),
                          const TextField(
                            autofocus: true,
                            decoration: InputDecoration(
                              hintText: 'Input',
                              border: OutlineInputBorder(),
                            ),
                          ),
                          FilledButton.tonal(
                            onPressed: () {},
                            child: const Row(
                              mainAxisAlignment: .center,
                              children: [
                                Icon(Icons.add, size: 22),
                                Text('Add'),
                              ],
                            ),
                          ),
                        ],
                      ),
                    );
                  },
                );
              },
              child: const Text('show BottomSheet'),
            ),
          ],
        ),
      ),
    );
  }
}
```

</details>


