        events.endOfStream();
      }
```

3. Listen to the stream:
```dart
      EventChannel(
        kTestEventChannelName,
      ).receiveBroadcastStream({'close': true}).listen((_) {});
```

4. Observe that the test hangs.

### Expected results

The test should not hang.

### Actual results

The test hangs. (Reproducible on stable [3.44.9](https://storage.googleapis.com/flutter_infra_release/releases/stable/macos/flutter_macos_3.44.9-stable.zip) and the latest beta build [3.47.0-0.4.pre](https://storage.googleapis.com/flutter_infra_release/releases/beta/macos/flutter_macos_3.47.0-0.4.pre-beta.zip))

### Code sample

