PROBE sheet visible DURING hold (deadline timer fired)
PROBE inject PointerUpEvent p=1
PROBE inject PointerUpEvent p=1 DONE      <- no "tree UP", no "router UP"
```

Second gesture — arena diagnostics show the recognizer stuck from gesture 1:

```
