### Steps to reproduce

1. Run the code sample below on an iOS 26 simulator or device (tested: iPhone 17 simulator, Flutter 3.47.1 stable, Impeller). It pushes a page whose scrollable has an orange box under the status bar and scrolls it by 150pt.
2. Look at the top ~60pt of the screen, or take a device screenshot (`xcrun simctl io booted screenshot out.png`).
3. Optional: hold a back-swipe part-way. The rounded page corner shows the same smear outside the arc.

### Expected results

